{
  "_README": [
    "Permissions are deliberately narrow on the git commands, per the house rule",
    "'A gate an agent can skip is not a gate. If a bypass flag exists, it is a",
    "human judgment call. Refuse it to the agent and leave it in the person's own",
    "terminal.'",
    "",
    "So there is no blanket Bash(git commit:*). The allowed forms below cannot",
    "carry --no-verify, which would skip .githooks/pre-commit. A person who needs",
    "that bypass runs it in their own terminal and says why in the commit message.",
    "",
    "Three hooks are wired here. .claude/hooks/*.sh header comments describe the",
    "same wiring; this file is the authority if they disagree, and",
    "04_tools/space_peak_contract_test.py checks C9 and C10 to keep them in sync."
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Read",
      "Glob",
      "Grep",
      "Edit",
      "Write",
      "Bash(ls:*)",
      "Bash(git status:*)",
      "Bash(git diff:*)",
      "Bash(git log:*)",
      "Bash(git show:*)",
      "Bash(git branch:*)",
      "Bash(git add:*)",
      "Bash(git commit -m:*)",
      "Bash(git commit -F:*)",
      "Bash(git checkout:*)",
      "Bash(git switch:*)",
      "Bash(git fetch:*)",
      "Bash(git stash:*)",
      "Bash(git pull --ff-only:*)",
      "Bash(git push origin:*)",
      "Bash(git worktree:*)",
      "Bash(git ls-files:*)",
      "Bash(git ls-tree:*)",
      "Bash(gh repo view:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr list:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr view:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr status:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr create:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr checks:*)",
      "Bash(gh issue list:*)",
      "Bash(gh issue view:*)",
      "Bash(gh run list:*)",
      "Bash(gh run view:*)",
      "Bash(python3 04_tools/space_peak_lint.py:*)",
      "Bash(python3 04_tools/space_peak_claims.py:*)",
      "Bash(python3 04_tools/space_peak_files.py:*)",
      "Bash(python3 04_tools/space_peak_contract_test.py:*)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(git commit --no-verify:*)",
      "Bash(git commit -n:*)",
      "Bash(git push --no-verify:*)",
      "Bash(git push --force:*)",
      "Bash(git push -f:*)",
      "Bash(git push origin main:*)",
      "Bash(git reset --hard:*)"
    ]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/space-peak-check-exclusions.sh\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/space-peak-content-guard.sh\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/space-peak-safety-snapshot.sh\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
